 "sentences": [
  {
   "beat": 1,
   "text": "This man ordered a burger.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 1.774
  },
  {
   "beat": 1,
   "text": "What he got... was a squirrel.",
   "start": 1.994,
   "end": 3.369
  },
  {
   "beat": 1,
   "text": "And somehow, this story is now taught to software teams all over the world.",
   "start": 3.589,
   "end": 8.001
  },
  {
   "beat": 2,
   "text": "Here's how it happened.",
   "start": 8.451,
   "end": 9.606
  },
  {
   "beat": 2,
   "text": "Meet Ray.",
   "start": 9.826,
   "end": 10.584
  },
  {
   "beat": 2,
   "text": "Ray flips burgers at a busy joint downtown.",
   "start": 10.804,
   "end": 13.382
  },
  {
   "beat": 2,
   "text": "It's Friday.",
   "start": 13.602,
   "end": 14.412
  },
  {
   "beat": 2,
   "text": "It's almost midnight.",
   "start": 14.632,
   "end": 15.723
  },
  {
   "beat": 2,
   "text": "And the line is wrapped around the block.",
   "start": 15.943,
   "end": 17.882
  },
  {
   "beat": 3,
   "text": "Ray's boss walks in and says one thing: \"Nobody leaves without a burger.",
   "start": 18.332,
   "end": 22.651
  },
  {
   "beat": 3,
   "text": "Nobody.\"",
   "start": 22.871,
   "end": 23.594
  },
  {
   "beat": 4,
   "text": "Ray turns to the fridge... and the beef is gone.",
   "start": 24.044,
   "end": 26.803
  },
  {
   "beat": 4,
   "text": "Not low.",
   "start": 27.023,
   "end": 27.752
  },
  {
   "beat": 4,
   "text": "Gone.",
   "start": 27.971,
   "end": 28.472
  },
  {
   "beat": 5,
   "text": "Now Ray has two choices.",
   "start": 28.922,
   "end": 30.451
  },
  {
   "beat": 5,
   "text": "Option one: walk out there and tell a hungry crowd, \"Sorry, we're out.\" Option two...",
   "start": 30.671,
   "end": 35.569
  },
  {
   "beat": 6,
   "text": "He looks out the back window.",
   "start": 36.019,
   "end": 37.438
  },
  {
   "beat": 6,
   "text": "And there, sitting on the trash can, is a squirrel.",
   "start": 37.658,
   "end": 40.143
  },
  {
   "beat": 7,
   "text": "Ray doesn't say no.",
   "start": 40.593,
   "end": 41.767
  },
  {
   "beat": 7,
   "text": "He grills it.",
   "start": 41.987,
   "end": 42.746
  },
  {
   "beat": 7,
   "text": "Buns it.",
   "start": 42.966,
   "end": 43.604
  },
  {
   "beat": 7,
   "text": "Serves it.",
   "start": 43.824,
   "end": 44.496
  },
  {
   "beat": 7,
   "text": "To a sweet old man in the corner booth, who takes the biggest bite of his life.",
   "start": 44.716,
   "end": 49.444
  },
  {
   "beat": 8,
   "text": "Three hours later?",
   "start": 49.894,
   "end": 51.051
  },
  {
   "beat": 8,
   "text": "The old man is in the hospital.",
   "start": 51.271,
   "end": 53.068
  },
  {
   "beat": 9,
   "text": "And the next morning, the headline doesn't say \"Ray.\" It says the name on the sign.",
   "start": 53.518,
   "end": 58.052
  },
  {
   "beat": 9,
   "text": "The whole brand takes the hit.",
   "start": 58.272,
   "end": 59.694
  },
  {
   "beat": 10,
   "text": "Now, did this really happen?",
   "start": 60.144,
   "end": 61.573
  },
  {
   "beat": 10,
   "text": "The story comes from Ken Schwaber, one of the creators of Scrum.",
   "start": 61.793,
   "end": 65.434
  },
  {
   "beat": 10,
   "text": "In 2015, someone asked him if it was real.",
   "start": 65.654,
   "end": 69.072
  },
  {
   "beat": 10,
   "text": "His answer?",
   "start": 69.292,
   "end": 70.061
  },
  {
   "beat": 10,
   "text": "\"It's a legend.\" But it keeps getting told... because every team has served a squirrel.",
   "start": 70.281,
   "end": 75.172
  },
  {
   "beat": 11,
   "text": "Think about it.",
   "start": 75.622,
   "end": 76.448
  },
  {
   "beat": 11,
   "text": "A deadline that can't move.",
   "start": 76.668,
   "end": 78.178
  },
  {
   "beat": 11,
   "text": "Work that doesn't fit.",
   "start": 78.398,
   "end": 79.589
  },
  {
   "beat": 11,
   "text": "And nobody willing to say no.",
   "start": 79.809,
   "end": 81.428
  },
  {
   "beat": 11,
   "text": "So someone quietly cuts quality.",
   "start": 81.648,
   "end": 83.674
  },
  {
   "beat": 11,
   "text": "Skips the tests.",
   "start": 83.894,
   "end": 84.937
  },
  {
   "beat": 11,
   "text": "Ships the bug.",
   "start": 85.157,
   "end": 86.042
  },
  {
   "beat": 11,
   "text": "And hopes nobody notices.",
   "start": 86.262,
   "end": 87.929
  },
  {
   "beat": 12,
   "text": "But someone always notices.",
   "start": 88.379,
   "end": 90.136
  },
  {
   "beat": 12,
   "text": "The customer.",
   "start": 90.356,
   "end": 91.165
  },
  {
   "beat": 12,
   "text": "The team.",
   "start": 91.385,
   "end": 92.061
  },
  {
   "beat": 12,
   "text": "The business.",
   "start": 92.281,
   "end": 93.027
  },
  {
   "beat": 13,
   "text": "So what should Ray have done?",
   "start": 93.477,
   "end": 94.872
  },
  {
   "beat": 13,
   "text": "Three things.",
   "start": 95.092,
   "end": 95.913
  },
  {
   "beat": 14,
   "text": "One.",
   "start": 96.363,
   "end": 96.834
  },
  {
   "beat": 14,
   "text": "Negotiate scope, not quality.",
   "start": 97.054,
   "end": 98.947
  },
  {
   "beat": 14,
   "text": "Fewer items on the menu.",
   "start": 99.167,
   "end": 100.695
  },
  {
   "beat": 14,
   "text": "Never a squirrel in the bun.",
   "start": 100.915,
   "end": 102.321
  },
  {
   "beat": 15,
   "text": "Two.",
   "start": 102.771,
   "end": 103.223
  },
  {
   "beat": 15,
   "text": "Serve the most valuable thing first.",
   "start": 103.443,
   "end": 105.482
  },
  {
   "beat": 15,
   "text": "A smaller order of real food beats a full tray of disaster.",
   "start": 105.702,
   "end": 109.612
  },
  {
   "beat": 16,
   "text": "Three.",
   "start": 110.062,
   "end": 110.596
  },
  {
   "beat": 16,
   "text": "Say it early.",
   "start": 110.816,
   "end": 111.648
  },
  {
   "beat": 16,
   "text": "The moment the beef looked low, that was the time to speak up.",
   "start": 111.868,
   "end": 115.214
  },
  {
   "beat": 16,
   "text": "Not at midnight.",
   "start": 115.434,
   "end": 116.408
  },
  {
   "beat": 17,
   "text": "Because when time runs out, you can cut the menu.",
   "start": 116.858,
   "end": 119.726
  },
  {
   "beat": 17,
   "text": "But never... serve the squirrel.",
   "start": 119.946,
   "end": 121.487
  }
 ],
